OL,3,ATech giant Nvidia to investigate
OL,4,AChinese spy claims after CEO admits
OL,5,Aaffair
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS tech giant Nvidia opens an
OL,8,Findependent investigation into claims
OL,9,Fits CEO Jensen Huang had an affair with
OL,10,Fa Chinese spy
OL,12,FIn a statement on Sunday, Huang
OL,13,Fadmitted to being unfaithful to his
OL,14,Fwife, adding he backs the investigation
OL,15,Fand is committed to "supporting
OL,16,FAmerica's national security"
OL,18,FNvidia - one of the most valuable firms
OL,19,Fin the world - says it has no reason to
OL,20,Fbelieve its secrets or national
OL,21,Fsecurity were compromised, but it will
OL,22,F"examine all available information"
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
