OL,3,ATech giant Nvidia to investigate
OL,4,AChinese spy claims after CEO admits
OL,5,Aaffair
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump says Huang is "a fine
OL,8,Fperson, but you never know what's going
OL,9,Fon"
OL,11,FMeanwhile, the Chinese government says
OL,12,Fthe claims are nothing more than a
OL,13,F"smear intended to malign China"
OL,15,FThe New York Times first reported last
OL,16,Fmonth that Huang had a close
OL,17,Frelationship with Alice Huang, a boss
OL,18,Fat a Singapore-based data centre
OL,19,Fcompany - and that she was suspected of
OL,20,Fgiving information to China
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
